IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-FLASHDEC2-PARTITION.

DATA DIVISION.
01 NUM-HEADS           PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 SEQ-LEN             PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 NUM-SMS             PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 WORK-SPLITS         PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-FLASHDEC2.
    IF NUM-HEADS == 0 OR SEQ-LEN == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    IF NUM-SMS == 0
        MOVE 108 TO NUM-SMS.
    END-IF.

    MOVE NUM-HEADS TO WORK-SPLITS.
    MULTIPLY SEQ-LEN BY WORK-SPLITS.
    DIVIDE NUM-SMS INTO WORK-SPLITS.
    IF WORK-SPLITS == 0
        MOVE 1 TO WORK-SPLITS.
    END-IF.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 WORK-SPLITS.
    WEIGHT 30 NUM-SMS.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
